<title>SWEDEN: Swedish producer prices fall 0.1 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Swedish producer prices fall 0.1 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish producer prices fell 0.1 percent in October, Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> (Percentage change)		Oct 96	 yr/yr</p>
<p> Export prices			-0.3	     -7.6</p>
<p> Import prices			+0.2	     -2.8</p>
<p> Producer prices		    -0.1	     -4.3</p>
<p>Note - The market had expected PPI to fall by 0.1 percent, according to a Reuter survey of 14 analysts.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
